### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### API Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

###

### Get all records
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/records

###

### Create new record
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2025-09-04",
  "truckId": "TR001",
  "invoiceNo": "INV001",
  "weights": [45.5, 42.3, 48.1],
  "buckleNumber": 3,
  "buckleWeight": 0.5
}

###

### Get statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/records/stats

###

### Get records with pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/records?page=1&limit=10&sortBy=date&sortOrder=desc

###
